####
The pentagon is composed of 4 triangles with areas: $\frac12\cdot 3\cdot 8=12$, $\frac12\cdot 6\cdot 8=24$, $\frac12\cdot 18\cdot 2=18$, and $\frac12\cdot 12\cdot 8=48$. Adding these areas gives a total of $\boxed{204}$.

